{"version":1,"key":"card:661","content":{"id":661,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4475dee3-f935-49f4-b4aa-be12fa57ad7e","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"isolation"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性用于控制元素是否应该创建一个新的层叠上下文（stacking context）。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"eed6a89d-3201-4404-93eb-811e854a68c5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"语法"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"b38b708a-b2a5-4837-9ba9-0c5ce9a28d8e","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f5ff47bf-c14a-4590-b0ab-3e56d87a460e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"isolation: auto | isolate;","collabId":"a235709b-b1ae-4bd6-a827-ef509d558e1e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"84481934-1a45-443c-834d-30c566a71ea6","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"d6b50006-c03e-4ed9-a0e5-38f50f8a8b79","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c5970d97-20d4-45ed-8e53-297985b5f866","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"auto"},{"type":"formatted","text":": 默认值。元素不会显式地创建一个新的层叠上下文，除非其他属性（如 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"opacity"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 小于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1"},{"type":"formatted","text":"）触发了层叠上下文的创建。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"37e7338f-86e4-4011-a3c1-20479a9202ea","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3223518e-eb56-4f78-a72b-d17f4ea7feb5","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"isolate"},{"type":"formatted","text":": 元素总是会创建一个新的层叠上下文。这意味着元素的内容会被隔离，外部的混合效果、背景效果等不会渗透到元素内部。"}]}]}]},{"type":"highlight-block","disableDrag":false,"color":"green","tauContract":"8d7373dfc1d83f7abd6f07067a85198c9127dba4aebf48d6d59b33956048da37","collabId":"f368e308-fd8e-47e6-857f-89b9af589a38","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一个应用场景，有一个需要根据视口来定位的元素，但是又希望它的显示范围在其父元素的范围之内，并且符合父元素的层级关系，一般情况下我们会给父元素设置 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"overflow: hidden"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，但是我们发现在这种情况单独设置给它的父元素设置 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"overflow: hidden"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是无效的，因为它的层叠上下文在根元素上，这个时候就可以给父元素设置 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ioslation: isolate"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，父元素形成了新的层叠上下文，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"fixed"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 布局的元素就会在这个上下文中，即使到处定位也会被这个层叠上下文限制。"}]}],"tags":["CSS/isolation","CSS/层叠上下文"],"createTime":1767422166275,"updateTime":1775708696894,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1775708696894}}